<description>&lt;p&gt;Jihadist groups JNIM and ISSP are still fighting in northern Burkina Faso while bandits in Niger State killed two kidnapping victims despite a six-million-naira ransom. Armed men attacked civilians in a Niger flashpoint, killing dozens, and an armed attack near Niger's western border left at least 38 dead. In Mali, 300 Russian mercenaries, likely Wagner and Africa Corps, were killed, and thousands of Arab nomads were ordered to leave southeast Niger. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOdTlIR1hDNnNhNU13VTNiTG8wNWpmZWtQN0JydkFNSWwzN21qMWVNeUVtb250cV9nYno0UTFVbDRKTTdLVkU2blU0SmhHMEUyS0lORGJGeE55RURWQ0NhbzRvYmxIQ1NESThiMGJhWWsxNU5RWGZXcVVnSXE0UUZELXlXNzJqd2M0VDAwTjFsRXVHODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOVWktbG1la3A4ODY3SnZxQ0hoU2dnMnlSTkJXRXRYXzZCUmVFa0l0cGtJbF9kSVZlQTZJZ1VGM3kxRWpFTndQamMzX1ozdTNwTUhlc2NEY21qSEpnMG5PeDdqNGlwOHY1bm5zUjNjTnFJZWY1VEF0UUJnWDdIUkp3aHo5ZHFFR3Q0NFpIeUNCV1J0ZGZXdTNWb2hYcU9OOEQzYkc5NU5PVVdrMkpjWTIyNk1XM3IwTEx1?oc=5&quot;&gt;the authority news&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5vempybEdteUFHYUhQYzB4VlVsV1VfZU9OczRXdjlFT0VqZlZvZTRiaTB0SjRBTVpFdGFXVWZsX21EQ05KcGsxczk2YVdpZFdlNTFyYmoydWJaSFZ0NXZwRDdaejdXbll1TjlDdF9MWUR1aGlXRlkw?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPWmgyMDVHUGNCbVVQZC11ZEFVTk0wMzN4X2RrZE9lMXVOcm40MllHQnctdHluaGR6ZTJJQm1lS0lnUlhjWC1CdjFZUlY0akpETVNyMDFvTGhHWFFfV0VaRmZCdVBfM2o5OHVlZFFia1oydEl0eEFkNk5FM0N5Z3JXamN4YTAwUXNTQ0c0VTB5ZUlDSTNNbXdUX3Fac3BIT1dzbE56RA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Мілітарний&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre